      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Category headings (National Universities, Private Universities, National Independent Colleges, Provincial Independent Colleges, Private Independent Colleges, National Technical Colleges, Provincial Technical Colleges, Private Technical Colleges) given as heading rows",
        "No. 2 Southwest Associated University: three presidents bracketed together, joined here with '; '. The first is printed with a damaged final letter that looks like 'Chiang Mon-lir'; transcribed as 'Chiang Mon-lin'",
        "Item numbered '40a' as printed (Hangchow Christian College, Baen E. Lee, Shaowu, Fukien); Hangchow Christian College appears again as No. 75 (R.J. McMullen, Shanghai)",
        "On pp. 387 and 389 the item numbers, names, presidents and locations are set on slightly different baselines (curved page); rows matched by order, counts agree in each group",
        "No. 55 location printed letter-spaced 'C h i n g m u k w a n, Chungking'",
        "No. 56 'College of Commerce, Chen Jui-lin, Kanchen, Hunan' and No. 96 'College of Commerce, Cheng Jui-lin, Kancheng, Hunan' as printed",
        "Hyphenated line-break words joined (e.g. 'Kwang-tung', 'Indus-trial', 'Commer-cial', 'Com-mercial'); 'Joint.College' printed with a stray point after 'Joint'"
      ],
